<title>USA: Image Dynamics and Gray, Kirk/VanSant to merge.</title>
<headline>Image Dynamics and Gray, Kirk/VanSant to merge.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The advertising and public relations firms Image Dynamics and Gray, Kirk/VanSant said on Wednesday that they will merge.</p>
<p>Both firms are privately held and based in Baltimore.</p>
</text>
